{"title":"Boneyard Vulture","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 36 Vulture that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 5 times (7.1% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: diveSpeedMult: 1.6</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/vulture-eye\">Vulture Eye</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/boneyard-vulture\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/boneyard-vulture?lv=34\">Lv 34 <span>7</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/boneyard-vulture?lv=35\">Lv 35 <span>19</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/boneyard-vulture?lv=36\">Lv 36 <span>57</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/boneyard-vulture?lv=37\">Lv 37 <span>19</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/boneyard-vulture?lv=38\">Lv 38 <span>8</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/boneyard-vulture?lv=39\">Lv 39 <span>7</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/boneyard-vulture?lv=40\">Lv 40 <span>27</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/boneyard-vulture?lv=34\" title=\"Pick level 34\"><td><b>34</b></td><td>145</td><td>23.2</td><td>1,700</td><td class=\"muted\">435 · 32.5 · 5,100</td><td>7</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Thak%20Muster%20Ground\">Old Thak Muster Ground</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/boneyard-vulture?lv=35\" title=\"Pick level 35\"><td><b>35</b></td><td>152</td><td>23.8</td><td>1,750</td><td class=\"muted\">456 · 33.3 · 5,250</td><td>19</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Thak%20Muster%20Ground\">Old Thak Muster Ground</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/boneyard-vulture?lv=36\" title=\"Pick level 36\"><td><b>36</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>160</td><td>24.3</td><td>1,800</td><td class=\"muted\">480 · 34 · 5,400</td><td>57</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Thak%20Muster%20Ground\">Old Thak Muster Ground</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/boneyard-vulture?lv=37\" title=\"Pick level 37\"><td><b>37</b></td><td>168</td><td>24.9</td><td>1,850</td><td class=\"muted\">504 · 34.9 · 5,550</td><td>19</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Thak%20Muster%20Ground\">Old Thak Muster Ground</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/boneyard-vulture?lv=38\" title=\"Pick level 38\"><td><b>38</b></td><td>176</td><td>25.4</td><td>1,900</td><td class=\"muted\">528 · 35.6 · 5,700</td><td>8</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Thak%20Muster%20Ground\">Old Thak Muster Ground</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/boneyard-vulture?lv=39\" title=\"Pick level 39\"><td><b>39</b></td><td>185</td><td>26</td><td>1,950</td><td class=\"muted\">555 · 36.4 · 5,850</td><td>7</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Thak%20Muster%20Ground\">Old Thak Muster Ground</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/boneyard-vulture?lv=40\" title=\"Pick level 40\"><td><